WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:02.652 --> 00:00:03.857
Hello there.

2
00:00:03.857 --> 00:00:05.884
Awhile back, I got a letter from a fan

3
00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:07.484
who lives in South Korea.

4
00:00:07.484 --> 00:00:09.318
Her name is Sunny Lee.

5
00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:12.262
She invited me to visit her country.

6
00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:15.046
She wrote this very long, detailed letter,

7
00:00:15.046 --> 00:00:18.203
and she wrote it on her SAT prep form.

8
00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:20.646
She said she can't prepare for her SATs

9
00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:21.926
'cause she's too busy watching

10
00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:24.240
episodes of my show.

11
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.152
Sunny also sent a bunch of cool Korean snacks.

12
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.400
Tons of them.

13
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.514
So I decided to visit Sunny in person to thank her.

14
00:00:31.514 --> 00:00:33.669
That's when I found out

15
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:37.338
that even though my show does not air in Korea,

16
00:00:37.338 --> 00:00:41.594
thanks to the Internet, I have some fans there.

17
00:00:41.594 --> 00:00:45.737
(speaking in Korean)

18
00:00:48.123 --> 00:00:50.666
(fans cheering)

19
00:00:56.078 --> 00:00:59.325
(audience clapping)

20
00:01:07.495 --> 00:01:09.526
(yelling in Korean)

21
00:01:14.189 --> 00:01:16.391
(fans screaming)

22
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.771
I love Korea!

23
00:01:27.931 --> 00:01:29.152
(audience laughs)

24
00:01:29.152 --> 00:01:30.694
Oh my god, it's so beautiful.

25
00:01:33.622 --> 00:01:35.777
Right here?

26
00:01:35.777 --> 00:01:37.412
Sunny Lee!

27
00:01:37.412 --> 00:01:39.432
Ohh! (fans chanting)

28
00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:43.835
Sunny Lee invited me.

29
00:01:45.344 --> 00:01:48.706
Sunny Lee, thank you so much.

30
00:01:48.706 --> 00:01:50.273
I'm going to go to my hotel now

31
00:01:50.273 --> 00:01:52.848
and shower because I stink.

32
00:02:00.247 --> 00:02:01.659
All right, hi, how are you?

33
00:02:03.287 --> 00:02:05.979
Oh hi, how are you?

34
00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:07.743
Thank you very much.

35
00:02:07.743 --> 00:02:09.081
Thank you.

36
00:02:10.881 --> 00:02:12.366
Oh my god.

